2026-01-06 23:35:15,977 - __main__ - INFO - SAMPLE QUERIES TO EXPLORE DATA
2026-01-06 23:35:15,977 - __main__ - INFO - ============================================================
2026-01-06 23:35:15,977 - __main__ - INFO - 1. All tasks in a project:
2026-01-06 23:35:15,978 - __main__ - INFO -    SELECT t.name, u.name as assignee, t.due_date
2026-01-06 23:35:15,978 - __main__ - INFO -    FROM tasks t LEFT JOIN users u ON t.assignee_id = u.id
2026-01-06 23:35:15,978 - __main__ - INFO -    WHERE t.project_id = (SELECT id FROM projects LIMIT 1)
2026-01-06 23:35:15,978 - __main__ - INFO - 
2026-01-06 23:35:15,979 - __main__ - INFO - 2. Overdue tasks by team:
2026-01-06 23:35:15,979 - __main__ - INFO -    SELECT t.name as team, COUNT(*) as overdue_tasks
2026-01-06 23:35:15,979 - __main__ - INFO -    FROM teams t
2026-01-06 23:35:15,979 - __main__ - INFO -    JOIN projects p ON t.id = p.team_id
2026-01-06 23:35:15,979 - __main__ - INFO -    JOIN tasks tk ON p.id = tk.project_id
2026-01-06 23:35:15,979 - __main__ - INFO -    WHERE tk.due_date < DATE('now') AND tk.completed = 0
2026-01-06 23:35:15,980 - __main__ - INFO -    GROUP BY t.name
2026-01-06 23:35:15,980 - __main__ - INFO - 
2026-01-06 23:35:15,980 - __main__ - INFO - 3. User workload:
2026-01-06 23:35:15,980 - __main__ - INFO -    SELECT u.name, COUNT(t.id) as task_count
2026-01-06 23:35:15,981 - __main__ - INFO -    FROM users u
2026-01-06 23:35:15,981 - __main__ - INFO -    LEFT JOIN tasks t ON u.id = t.assignee_id
2026-01-06 23:35:15,981 - __main__ - INFO -    GROUP BY u.name
2026-01-06 23:35:15,982 - __main__ - INFO -    ORDER BY task_count DESC
